From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hjviewer <haejin.cho@yonsei.ac.kr>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 05:16:51 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 131/161] hjviewer: port forwarding and RDP in the app's look
 (U15)

U15 (UX-S5), the desktop part, third commit (the one to leave out
first if 1.9.0 runs late, u15.md review).

- The 'Listening ...' bar (was a solid green 45 px bar) is an
  HjvCallout in the success tone with the tip as its text.
- The table in a card (hjvCardDecoration, clipped to its radius); the
  heads 36 high in hjvFileHeadStyle with a bottom border; the add row
  and the RDP row without a background, their arrows
  arrow_forward_rounded 18 px textTertiary; the tunnel rows 48 high
  without zebra stripes, a top border, body text (ports with digits of
  one width), the remove x 18 px textSecondary with the existing
  'Delete' tooltip. The RDP row's text in body size.

No text changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
